  "changes": [
    "Renamed ROS and Python packaging from solo_mpc to solo_mpc_hardware.",
    "ros_utils.py: removed simulation world CLI option and optional solo_bringup startup-progress hook.",
    "Selected controller, optional marker detector, and their local dependency closure; numerical/controller/perception logic unchanged.",
    "Added a standalone launch file, installed single-UAV configuration examples, native dependency locks, and integration/sharing documentation.",
    "Example configuration retains simulation-derived physical tuning; no preloaded obstacles, one UAV, diagnostic disk capture disabled.",
    "SIGINT ownership: workers ignore terminal interrupts; the ROS wrapper finishes bounded cleanup despite a repeated launch SIGINT."
